OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to trial new
OL,4,Apothole-fixing machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will trial new technology as
OL,7,Fpart of efforts to improve how it
OL,8,Ftackles potholes across the borough.
OL,10,FThe decision was approved as North East
OL,11,FLincolnshire councillors agreed a
OL,12,F#17.4m highways and transport capital
OL,13,Fprogramme for 2026-27.
OL,15,FThe plans include about #168,000 for
OL,16,Fmaintenance and innovation trials,
OL,17,Fincluding JCB's Pothole Pro machine,
OL,18,Fwhich is claimed to repair road defects
OL,19,Fmore efficiently than traditional
OL,20,Fmethods.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
