OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to trial new
OL,4,Apothole-fixing machines
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Oliver Freeston said
OL,7,Ftackling potholes was a priority for
OL,8,Fthe Reform UK administration and
OL,9,Fwelcomed the inclusion of trials for
OL,10,Fnew technology.
